[SetUp "1"]
[UTCDate "2025.11.25"]
[UTCTime "03:09:21"]
[ChapterMode "gamebook"]

{ Taking the queen doesn't look too bad, and maybe it's not (it does lead to an eventual win). The better choice is Qxf7. }
8. Qxf7 { If black takes the rook, white plays Qxg8 and picks up tempo. If black takes the queen, white plays Rxa7, and same thing. Black has to play Qxe2. } 8... Qxe2 { This one looks scary. Think about it for a minute. } 9. Kxe2 { Yes! Now it's all but over. } 9... a6 10. Rxa6 Nxa6 11. Qxg8 Raxg8 12. Bg5 Rxg5 13. Rg1 Rxg1 14. Bg2 Rxg2 15. Kd2 Rxf2 16. Kd1 Rxh2 17. Kd2 Rxd2# *


[Event "Let's Learn the Wizard Opening - antichess: 5. Nxe2 Qxd2 (6. Qxe8 Qxc1 variation)"]
[Date "2025.11.25"]
[Result "*"]
[Variant "Antichess"]
